                                                                <label> Ground Water Monitoring</label>
                                                            </a>
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="col-md-8">
                                                            <p class="sometext">
                                                                Ground water is being depleted at a rapid rate and over
                                                                exploitation of ground water is happening across the world. There is an urgent need
                                                                to monitor and assess ground water resources. Monitoring helps in understanding
                                                                the changing water storage conditions at a particular place. The data collected by
                                                                monitoring ground water can be used to determine its availability, usage, interaction
                                                                with local surface water sources, and understanding how surface development has
                                                                impacted the aquifer.
                                                            </p>

                                                        </li>
                                                    </ul>

                                                </div>
                                                <div role="tabpanel" class="tab-pane fade" id="Videos">
