                                                                <label>Water Security</label>
                                                            </a>
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="col-md-8">
                                                            <p class="sometext">
                                                                Water security is the capacity of a population to safeguard
                                                                adequate quantities of quality water for sustaining livelihoods, human well-being, and
                                                                socio-economic development. The main purpose of water security tool is to estimate
                                                                the total water budget required for managing adequate quantities of water resources
                                                                based on its demand and supply..
                                                            </p>

                                                        </li>
